{
  "id": "67da399c5bcd8c577d0cf022",
  "title": "赤リンクは行き止まり",
  "created": 1742354850,
  "updated": 1786060331,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "67da399c5bcd8c577d0cf022",
      "text": "赤リンクは行き止まり",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1742354850,
      "updated": 1742354850
    },
    {
      "id": "67da39a15b98c20000d8b151",
      "text": "[赤リンク]は[行き止まり]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1742354850,
      "updated": 1742354861
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73c7860000000000e916a0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785972615,
      "updated": 1785984654
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73f579000000000042f6e0",
      "text": "赤リンクの先は[空ページ]、何も書かれていないページ",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785984377,
      "updated": 1785984438
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73f606000000000042f6e2",
      "text": "　何も書かれていないので行き止まり",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785984518,
      "updated": 1785984543
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73f591000000000042f6e1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785984401,
      "updated": 1785984401
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbd97700000000003834e1",
      "text": "　　code:mermaid",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776015735,
      "updated": 1785984401
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbd97800000000003834e2",
      "text": "   graph LR",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776015736,
      "updated": 1776015736
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbd97800000000003834e3",
      "text": "   Q(起点ページ)<-->B1(ページ)<-->B2(ページ)-->|赤リンク|B3((空ページ))",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776015736,
      "updated": 1785968785
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbd97800000000003834e4",
      "text": "   Q-->C1(ページ)-->C2(ページ)-->|青リンク|C3((空ページ))",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776015736,
      "updated": 1785968795
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdb1200000000003834f1",
      "text": "   Q-->D1(ページ)-->D2(ページ)-->|青リンク|C3",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016146,
      "updated": 1776016317
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdab200000000003834ef",
      "text": "   B1<-->C1",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016050,
      "updated": 1776016062
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdaea00000000003834f0",
      "text": "   B2<-->C2",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016106,
      "updated": 1776016115
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbd97800000000003834e5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776015736,
      "updated": 1776016467
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe41c0000000000383503",
      "text": "行き止まりにならないようにページを作り、リンクをはる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776018461,
      "updated": 1776018552
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73c7cf0000000000e916a1",
      "text": " リンクをはることで思考の道筋（理路）ができる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785972687,
      "updated": 1785972781
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73c9560000000000e916a4",
      "text": " 　思考がスムーズに流れるようになる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785973079,
      "updated": 1785973137
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73c7df0000000000e916a2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785972704,
      "updated": 1785972704
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc5400000000003834f3",
      "text": "　　code:mermaid",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016468,
      "updated": 1785972704
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc5500000000003834f4",
      "text": "   graph LR",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016469,
      "updated": 1776016469
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc5500000000003834f5",
      "text": "   Q(起点ページ)<-->B1(ページ)<-->B2(ページ)-->B3(ページ)",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016469,
      "updated": 1776016517
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc5500000000003834f6",
      "text": "   Q-->C1(ページ)-->C2(ページ)-->C3(ページ)",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016469,
      "updated": 1776016488
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc5500000000003834f7",
      "text": "   Q-->D1(ページ)-->D2(ページ)-->C3",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016469,
      "updated": 1776016481
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc5500000000003834f8",
      "text": "   B1<-->C1",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016469,
      "updated": 1776016469
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc5500000000003834f9",
      "text": "   B2<-->C2",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016469,
      "updated": 1776016469
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc9300000000003834fb",
      "text": "   B3<-->C3",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016531,
      "updated": 1776016546
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdc9400000000003834fc",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776016532,
      "updated": 1776016532
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73c8540000000000e916a3",
      "text": "　思考が活性化され、他のページやリンクをつくることができる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785972821,
      "updated": 1785984619
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe4a70000000000383504",
      "text": "ただし、作成したページから、また赤リンクは生えてくるので、どの程度許容できるかという程度問題だろう",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776018599,
      "updated": 1776018715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73c6700000000000e9169c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785972337,
      "updated": 1785972337
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73c6700000000000e9169d",
      "text": "また、ページはあるのに、リンクでつながっていないページを[孤立ページ]という",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785972337,
      "updated": 1785972439
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdef900000000009bf53e",
      "text": " おそらく関係ない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776017145,
      "updated": 1785984703
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73f6a0000000000042f6e4",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785984672,
      "updated": 1785984672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73ce810000000000e916a6",
      "text": "行き止まりから先に進むには",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785974401,
      "updated": 1785974441
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73ceaa0000000000e916a9",
      "text": "　勇気がいる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785974443,
      "updated": 1785974457
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73f6c1000000000042f6e5",
      "text": "　[赤リンクを潰す]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785984705,
      "updated": 1785984733
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73cebb0000000000e916aa",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785974459,
      "updated": 1785974459
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73ce810000000000e916a7",
      "text": "[hr.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785974401,
      "updated": 1785974459
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdefa00000000009bf53f",
      "text": "例外: 他プロジェクトからリンクされている場合",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1776017146,
      "updated": 1776017152
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbdf0100000000009bf541",
      "text": "\tただしページ化しないと表示されない",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1776017153,
      "updated": 1776017173
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe0aa0000000000383502",
      "text": "\t よくわからないのですが、こういうことですか？[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776017578,
      "updated": 1776017619
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe01d00000000003834fd",
      "text": "　　code:mermaid",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776017438,
      "updated": 1776017440
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe02000000000003834fe",
      "text": "   graph LR",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776017440,
      "updated": 1776017440
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe02000000000003834ff",
      "text": "   Q(起点ページ)-->B1(空ページ)",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776017440,
      "updated": 1776017474
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe0410000000000383501",
      "text": "   X(他プロジェクト)-->|external link|B1",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776017474,
      "updated": 1776017733
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe0200000000000383500",
      "text": "\t\tですです[terang.icon]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1776017440,
      "updated": 1776017966
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe7ba0000000000383505",
      "text": "\t\t [External Links] はまた別の話になるよ、と理解してよろしいでしょうか？ [suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1776019386,
      "updated": 1776019492
    },
    {
      "id": "69dbe22e000000000035c49e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1776017966,
      "updated": 1776017966
    },
    {
      "id": "6a74a2820000000000e41506",
      "text": "赤リンクは[入り口]という感覚があるかも[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1786028674,
      "updated": 1786028688
    },
    {
      "id": "6a74a2900000000000e41507",
      "text": "　その単語・フレーズが使われた（現時点では）唯一の箇所への窓口",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1786028688,
      "updated": 1786028719
    },
    {
      "id": "69e490020000000000668d00",
      "text": " これはわかる[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1776586755,
      "updated": 1786028706
    },
    {
      "id": "6a750dca000000000081db3d",
      "text": " この指摘はありがたいです[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786056139,
      "updated": 1786056349
    },
    {
      "id": "6a750dea000000000081db3e",
      "text": " 　「[コップに水が]…」みたいに、見る人によって、入り口になったり、行き止まりになったりするってことですね",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786056170,
      "updated": 1786056311
    },
    {
      "id": "6a751d130000000000bef8a8",
      "text": " おもしろい視点[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1786060046,
      "updated": 1786060111
    },
    {
      "id": "6a751d510000000000bef8a9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1786060107,
      "updated": 1786060108
    },
    {
      "id": "6a751d510000000000bef8aa",
      "text": "赤リンクは将来つながるかもしれないハンドルとして捉えてる[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1786060108,
      "updated": 1786060173
    },
    {
      "id": "6a751d920000000000bef8ab",
      "text": "　まだつながっていないフロンティア",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1786060173,
      "updated": 1786060187
    },
    {
      "id": "6a751da00000000000bef8ac",
      "text": "　十年後に意外なところでつながるかもしれない",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1786060187,
      "updated": 1786060212
    },
    {
      "id": "6a751dc00000000000bef8ad",
      "text": "　一種の投資？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1786060219,
      "updated": 1786060242
    },
    {
      "id": "6a751dd90000000000bef8ae",
      "text": " 赤リンクは種まきかも",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1786060244,
      "updated": 1786060252
    },
    {
      "id": "6a751de20000000000bef8af",
      "text": "それとは別に、[Scrapboxのリンクは実質強調表現]だとして、マーカー代わりに赤リンクを作ることもある",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1786060252,
      "updated": 1786060331
    },
    {
      "id": "6a74a29a00000000007ef0b1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1786028699,
      "updated": 1786028699
    },
    {
      "id": "6a73f676000000000042f6e3",
      "text": "#考え中",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785984630,
      "updated": 1785984642
    },
    {
      "id": "69e490030000000000668d01",
      "text": "[道のメタファー]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1776586755,
      "updated": 1776586755
    },
    {
      "id": "69e490030000000000668d02",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1776586755,
      "updated": 1776586755
    }
  ]
}